# class.http에서 생성한 클래스, 슬롯 ID 
@classId = cml4jf42j00075c8tniiyf2qw
@slotId = cml4jhzuv000e5c8trpuayxno
@reservationId = cml4jic57000f5c8tdaoo7izv


### 1. [고객] 예약 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "slotId": "{{slotId}}"
}

### 2. [고객] 내 예약 목록 조회 (전체)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 3. [고객] 내 예약 목록 조회 (BOOKED만)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?status=BOOKED
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 4. [고객] 예약 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 5. [고객] 예약 취소
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "cancelNote": "개인 사정으로 취소합니다"
}


### 6. [판매자] 주간 슬롯 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/seller/slots?startDate=2026-02-01&endDate=2026-02-28
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### 7. [판매자] 내 센터 예약 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/seller/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### 8. [판매자] 유저 예약 강제 취소
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/seller/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

{
  "cancelNote": "강사 사정으로 인한 휴강"
}

### 9. [판매자] 예약 완료 처리
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### 10. [관리자] 전체 예약 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/admin/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. [관리자] 예약 통계
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/admin/reservations/stats?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 12. [관리자] 예약 강제 취소
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reservations/admin/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "cancelNote": "운영 정책 위반"
}
